                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na wana watatu wa Seruya walikuwako huko, Yoabu, na Abishai, na Asaheli; na Asaheli alikuwa mwepesi wa miguu kama kulungu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naye Asaheli akamfuatia Abneri; na katika kwenda kwake hakugeuka kwenda mkono wa kuume wala mkono wa kushoto katika kumfuatia Abneri. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Abneri akatazama nyuma yake, akasema, Ni wewe, Asaheli? Akajibu, Ni mimi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1SA.17.42"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Sam 17:42",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Basi Abneri akamwambia, Geuka mkono wa kuume au mkono wa kushoto, ukamshike mmoja wa vijana, ukazitwae silaha zake. Lakini Asaheli hakukubali kugeuka na kuacha kumfuata. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abneri akamwambia Asaheli mara ya pili, Geuka, acha kunifuatia mimi; kwa nini nikupige hata chini? Hapo ningewezaje kuinua uso wangu mbele ya Yoabu, ndugu yako? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
