          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akarudi Yoabu naye kutoka kumfuatia Abneri; na alipokwisha kuwakusanya watu wote pamoja, wa hao watumishi wa Daudi walipungukiwa na watu kumi na kenda pamoja na Asaheli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2SA 2:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ila watumishi wa Daudi walikuwa wamewapiga watu wa Benyamini, na watu wa Abneri, hata wakafa watu mia tatu na sitini. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2SA.2.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2SA.2.31"
            ]
          }
        },
